{"blocks": [{"anchorId": "exam-sequence", "keyed": false, "kind": "explanation", "markdown": "**The exam sequence** for Arts. 5\u201316 is: (1) Is it a **consumer product** within the law? (2) Is there a **mandatory consumer product standard** or applicable technical regulation? (3) Is the product **unsafe, injurious, dangerous, or noncompliant**? (4) Which **agency/notice/recall or corrective procedure** applies? (5) What **prohibited act or penalty** is triggered?", "sourceRefs": [{"excerptHint": "Exam sequence", "page": "p. 2", "section": "Sec. 2", "sourceId": "src.r02"}]}, {"anchorId": "framework-table", "keyed": false, "kind": "comparisonTable", "sourceRefs": [{"excerptHint": "Arts. 5-16 framework", "page": "p. 2", "section": "Sec. 2", "sourceId": "src.r02"}], "table": {"caption": "The quality and safety framework (Arts. 5\u201316)", "columns": ["Article cluster", "Subject"], "rows": [["Art. 5", "Policy framework for consumer product quality and safety."], ["Arts. 7\u20139", "Standards and related regulatory mechanisms."], ["Arts. 10\u201311", "Injurious, dangerous or unsafe products."], ["Arts. 12\u201316", "Special rules for new, imported and export products."]]}}, {"anchorId": "art5-policy", "keyed": false, "kind": "provision", "provisionId": "prov.ra7394-art5", "sourceRefs": [{"excerptHint": "Art. 5 policy framework", "page": "p. 2", "section": "Sec. 2", "sourceId": "src.r02"}]}, {"anchorId": "standards-arts7-9", "keyed": false, "kind": "provision", "provisionId": "prov.ra7394-arts7-9", "sourceRefs": [{"excerptHint": "Standards and regulatory mechanisms", "page": "p. 2", "section": "Sec. 2", "sourceId": "src.r02"}]}, {"anchorId": "unsafe-products-arts10-11", "keyed": false, "kind": "provision", "provisionId": "prov.ra7394-arts10-11", "sourceRefs": [{"excerptHint": "Injurious, dangerous or unsafe products", "page": "p. 2", "section": "Sec. 2", "sourceId": "src.r02"}]}, {"anchorId": "new-imported-export-arts12-16", "keyed": false, "kind": "provision", "provisionId": "prov.ra7394-arts12-16", "sourceRefs": [{"excerptHint": "New, imported and export products", "page": "p. 2", "section": "Sec. 2", "sourceId": "src.r02"}]}, {"anchorId": "special-product-groups", "keyed": false, "kind": "comparisonTable", "sourceRefs": [{"excerptHint": "Special product groups", "page": "p. 2", "section": "Sec. 2", "sourceId": "src.r02"}], "table": {"caption": "Special product groups called out by the syllabus", "columns": ["Product group", "Article range"], "rows": [["Food", "Arts. 23\u201327"], ["Drugs and antibiotics", "Arts. 29\u201334"], ["Cosmetics", "Art. 35"], ["Hazardous substances", "Arts. 44\u201345 and the statute's definitions"], ["Prohibited acts", "Arts. 18\u201319, 40\u201341, 46\u201347"]]}}, {"anchorId": "food-arts23-27", "keyed": false, "kind": "provision", "provisionId": "prov.ra7394-food", "sourceRefs": [{"excerptHint": "Food", "page": "p. 2", "section": "Sec. 2", "sourceId": "src.r02"}]}, {"anchorId": "drugs-arts29-34", "keyed": false, "kind": "provision", "provisionId": "prov.ra7394-drugs", "sourceRefs": [{"excerptHint": "Drugs and antibiotics", "page": "p. 2", "section": "Sec. 2", "sourceId": "src.r02"}]}, {"anchorId": "cosmetics-art35", "keyed": false, "kind": "provision", "provisionId": "prov.ra7394-cosmetics", "sourceRefs": [{"excerptHint": "Cosmetics", "page": "p. 2", "section": "Sec. 2", "sourceId": "src.r02"}]}, {"anchorId": "hazardous-arts44-45", "keyed": false, "kind": "provision", "provisionId": "prov.ra7394-hazardous", "sourceRefs": [{"excerptHint": "Hazardous substances", "page": "p. 2", "section": "Sec. 2", "sourceId": "src.r02"}]}, {"anchorId": "prohibited-safety-acts", "keyed": false, "kind": "provision", "provisionId": "prov.ra7394-prohibited-safety", "sourceRefs": [{"excerptHint": "Prohibited acts", "page": "p. 2", "section": "Sec. 2", "sourceId": "src.r02"}]}, {"anchorId": "no-generic-rule", "keyed": false, "kind": "note", "markdown": "**Do not use one generic safety rule in place of the specific subchapter.** Food, drugs/antibiotics, cosmetics, and hazardous substances each have their own article range; match the product to its subchapter first.", "severity": "trap", "sourceRefs": [{"excerptHint": "Use the specific subchapter", "page": "p. 2", "section": "Sec. 2", "sourceId": "src.r02"}]}, {"anchorId": "banned-recalled-status", "keyed": false, "kind": "explanation", "markdown": "Where a question concerns a product that has been **banned, recalled, misbranded or found unsafe**, identify the **precise legal status** and the **statutory actor responsible** for the act or omission.", "sourceRefs": [{"excerptHint": "Banned/recalled/unsafe products", "page": "p. 2", "section": "Sec. 2", "sourceId": "src.r02"}]}, {"anchorId": "sources", "keyed": false, "kind": "sourceList", "sourceRefs": [{"page": "p. 2", "section": "Sec. 2", "sourceId": "src.r02"}]}], "coverage": "COVERED", "description": "The safety and quality framework: standards, unsafe products, special product groups, and prohibited acts.", "id": "les.consumer.quality-safety", "kind": "lesson", "title": "Consumer product quality and safety", "topicId": "ba166.consumer.quality-safety"}